 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "Nordic Anchor &amp; Steel Pile Supply AB (NASPS AB) is proud to contribute to the development of a new mountain hotel in Sälen, with Scandic Hotels Group as the operator."
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "The project involves the construction of a modern hotel with approximately 120 rooms, apartments and associated facilities in an attractive ski-in/ski-out location between Tandådalen and Hundfjället."
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "As part of the foundation works, NASPS has supplied 85 T76/51 self-drilling anchors (SDA) to the project. The delivery supports an efficient and safe installation in the geotechnically challenging conditions of the mountain environment."
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "The delivery was carried out in collaboration with Nordisk Pål och Borrteknik AB as drilling contractor. NASPS AB thanks them for the order and looks forward to further collaborations."
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "NASPS delivers high-quality products for geotechnical foundation work in complex environments. Our self-drilling anchor systems enable fast installation and high reliability, even under challenging ground conditions."
 },
 {
  "type": "end",
  "name": "Post Content"
